    <h2 id="story-h" class="sr-only">The story</h2>
    <p class="bigtext">The pandemic hit a lot of people. For Maleek, <span class="hl">it landed on top of everything else.</span></p>
    <p>Maleek had left a corporate job to start a business, and almost all the money was gone. Less than a year later, and a year after a tragic loss of a family member, COVID hit. Almost every opportunity dried up, and Maleek was stuck in a new home with rent, car payments and the everyday cost of living bearing down.</p>
    <p>There were no words for any of it, and nobody else was saying them either.</p>
    <p>So Maleek started saying them, first privately, then in posts. Plenty of people turned out to need them too. <strong>Maleek decided to be that voice</strong> for anyone still looking for the words.</p>
